 Author: wanglei@hachist.com
 上海哈船智能船舶技术有限公司
 File: package.xml
 Brief: Manifest for rtk_driver -- a NON-ROS plain-CMake package (build_type cmake)

 Description:
 rtk_driver is a non-ROS C++ process (CLAUDE.md 0.2): it publishes to the RT-plane
 Zenoh, not ROS topics, so it declares build_type cmake and depends on NO ROS
 package (no rclcpp / sensor_msgs / std_msgs). It builds today with plain cmake +
 make on the ORIN, which has no colcon / ROS2 installed; if colcon is later
 available it will pick this up as a plain-CMake package. Its only dependency is
 the header-only common/ foundation, consumed by include path (nothing to link).
-->
<package format="3">
  <name>rtk_driver</name>
  <version>2.0.0</version>
  <description>Dual-antenna RTK GNSS driver: NMEA -> RT-plane GnssHeading (11 S3.3)</description>
  <maintainer email="wanglei@hachist.com">wanglei</maintainer>
  <license>Apache-2.0</license>

  <buildtool_depend>cmake</buildtool_depend>

  <export>
    <build_type>cmake</build_type>
  </export>
</package>
